<http://data.silknow.org/object/fdc2e6b8-babf-356d-aec6-c1afc2902bea/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Wall hanging of embroidered cotton with silk yarn in chain stitch. Cream cotton ground with silk chain stitch embroidery pattern of blue leaves, red-and-yellow flowers and multi-coloured birds and animals. Made of two panels stitched together vertically. Possibly also for a bed, but traces of nail holes at the sides suggest it was used as a wall-hanging at some stage."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/fdc2e6b8-babf-356d-aec6-c1afc2902bea> .

